# 30 Days AI Challenge – NLP Apps with Hugging Face Transformers
### BTech 1st Year | DistilBERT • BART • RoBERTa | PyTorch

Built 4 mini AI apps by bypassing pipeline errors using AutoTokenizer + AutoModel method.

*Live Demo:* https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1857LQHk-8d7DUIByDeeCwQQwZQQJ55Jd?usp=sharing

## Day 1: Sentiment Analysis
Model: distilbert-base-uncased-finetuned-sst-2-english
Concept: Tokenizer = Security Guard, Transformer = Principal

## Day 2: Text Summarization (Abstractive)
Model: facebook/bart-large-cnn
Fixed: KeyError Unknown task summarization with AutoModelForSeq2SeqLM

## Day 3: Question Answering (Extractive)
Model: distilbert-base-cased-distilled-squad
Concept: Finds start/end logits from context

## Day 4: Emotion Detection (7 Emotions)
Model: j-hartmann/emotion-english-distilroberta-base
Concept: Softmax converts logits to % for joy, fear, anger etc

## Tech Stack
Python, PyTorch, Hugging Face Transformers, Google Colab

